":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/commit/be02477811f4e21b36c7ad2ee4e573db215054a4"}]},{"sha":"4637e625c99ef17c190aa471a5e51b7f646c6dfd","node_id":"C_kwDOR6jjtdoAKDQ2MzdlNjI1Yzk5ZWYxN2MxOTBhYTQ3MWE1ZTUxYjdmNjQ2YzZkZmQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Jonah Gray","email":"jonah@omninode.ai","date":"2026-07-30T16:06:51Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-30T16:06:51Z"},"message":"feat(OMN-15418): preserve typed registry declarations (#1964)\n\n* feat(OMN-15418): preserve typed registry declarations\n\n* test(OMN-15418): shrink topic graph baseline\n\n* chore(OMN-15418): pin typed registry companion\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Jonah Gray <jonah.g.gray@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"3387f3dc5eb02a3c2c5a71a3e8725dbaa3a16db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/git/trees/3387f3dc5eb02a3c2c5a71a3e8725dbaa3a16db5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/git/commits/4637e625c99ef17c190aa471a5e51b7f646c6dfd","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqa3abCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyZgQAA2ANAk6ZvTChCeZY+93jkBf\ns28GEIkM18Bki6rApZGTfwp0nI77MHacHtcyuyxlqFEae5RUY1kuQDF4YtLusS9V\npSI9JyCQ0Rnq/LXPAwZT/6F9AqMsE/Fek6A0NLIxe3oDeBF/TX5sWqomBW0Ch8fC\nMlroOQ8kbLzcjl63XcyUj/HB705BJ5LZATadq4HMsIvzrq+hYabNc/LazPkzsTm3\n8YCcoxxRz414Qi34CDhRDExrvf60rqpwt6NTSaZcBWrfB+mMkAVjM12dgp+c1EQ9\n/mowTd4Xpl9UoiVrQvC9FtDUODoGCYplnVDE7WxZ2eqwRX7rJfNce4f9CNF0C994\nmHaPQjimAI/EtzjQciTrsLxUxa2XNKRLF0VLxL+TjIKpoe/8x4GFrvSG3MWbdGDW\nwjqJD/BBrOEkERS3IHUxZCTwzH/Po8R16cQzcSpi1WO7A4rFVd6CXV/0y3rcXnC8\nlS4+XVaEstOLjSSbWdBCn5QOIs/QPuLWwHeiCqCWXur/+GmKFLpvcXCXVfvaPO3u\npPYG3J5dG3B5AflxlM0Ql/ihxCjRQeZbWx/tccIWLdp2+LSq2F+dVohcqjlr+XxO\nmBG0ULQWguVU2vqjgyWBi6c72RXiiA1sFRuWeLlr52Jgf3YSdgMIccGDghUhj9bS\nP0ycsCAWZXBGos9VAx1l\n=gwV3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 3387f3dc5eb02a3c2c5a71a3e8725dbaa3a16db5\nparent a0f65e9471da06b88eecb91bbc1c847989